nter" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/securities-services">Securities Services</a></div></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 text-right justify-center"><img alt="Arrow icon" loading="lazy" width="20" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="dark:invert" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/rightArrow.svg"/></div><div class="py-2.5 flex justify-start items-center text-nowrap"><div class="cs-text justify-center text-center text-neutral-900 dark:text-white"><a class="text-center" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/securities-services/digital-infrastructure">Digital Solutions</a></div></div></div><div class="relative grid gap-12 w-full h-full grid-cols-1"><div class="bg-gray dark:bg-dark_primary h-[650px] xl:h-[680px] relative flex flex-col w-full max-w-full z-0 gap-6 rounded-3xl"><div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full overflow-hidden z-[-1] rounded-3xl"><picture class="max-w-full max-h-full"><source media="(max-width:640px)" srcSet="/caas/v1/media/5458250/data/915dd3cd5b3c71e8206313f9312b4896/portrait_ratio1x1/650/digital-00-stageimage.jpg"/><source media="(max-width:768px)" srcSet="/caas/v1/media/5458250/data/915dd3cd5b3c71e8206313f9312b4896/landscape_ratio8x7/743/digital-00-stageimage.jpg"/><source media="(max-width:1024px)" srcSet="/caas/v1/media/5458250/data/915dd3cd5b3c71e8206313f9312b4896/landscape_ratio3x2/975/digital-00-stageimage.jpg"/><img src="/caas/v1/media/5458250/data/915dd3cd5b3c71e8206313f9312b4896/landscape_ratio2x1/1500/digital-00-stageimage.jpg" alt="StageImage" loading="eager" fetchPriority="high" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/></picture><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background-position:center;background-size:cover;pointer-events:none"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col p-5 py-10 md:p-10 justify-end h-full lg:max-w-[75%]"><div class="cs-h5 uppercase text-white/50 pb-8 xl:pb-3">Digital Infrastructure</div><h2 class="cs-h1 justify-start pb-3 xl:pb-5 text-white ">Digital First. Hybrid by Design.</h2><div class="cs-text-big max-w-full self-stretch justify-center md:pt-3 xl:pt-0  text-white ">Clearstream&#x27;s post-trade infrastructure operates traditional and digital assets within one platform, fully interoperable and accessible on your terms.</div></div></div><section class="w-full flex justify-center items-center mx-auto"><div class="w-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center rounded-3xl"><h2 class="cs-h2 w-full flex items-center justify-center text-center dark:text-white mb-5 px-8 md:px-0 xl:pr-0 lg:pl-0"></h2><div class="cs-text-big w-full text-center dark:text-white text-neutral-900/50 xl:max-w-full md:px-0 px-0 sm:px-6 lg:pl-0 lg:pr-[5px]"><div class="relative richtext flex items-center flex-col"><p class="rt">Digital assets are scaling rapidly, driven by efficiency gains and institutional adoption. Emerging technologies are reshaping financial infrastructure and creating opportunities for issuers, investors, and intermediaries alike.</p></div></div></div></section><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 justify-center" role="list"><section class="min-h-[365px] md:min-h-[250px] lg:min-h-[300px] bg-gradient-secondary rounded-[10px] md:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[15px] px-5 lg:px-6 xl:px-7 py-7 max-w-full lg:max-w-[487px] w-full flex flex-col" role="listitem"><div class="flex-grow"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="cs-h3 text-white">Interoperability</h3><p class="cs-text text-white">Fragmented networks and processes create inefficiencies, restricting the free flow of assets and data across markets.</p></div></section><section class="min-h-[365px] md:min-h-[250px] lg:min-h-[300px] bg-gradient-secondary rounded-[10px] md:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[15px] px-5 lg:px-6 xl:px-7 py-7 max-w-full lg:max-w-[487px] w-full flex flex-col" role="listitem"><div class="flex-grow"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="cs-h3 text-white">Liquidity</h3><p class="cs-text text-white">Disconnected infrastructures can fragment liquidity, resulting in lower efficiency and higher operational costs.</p></div></section><section class="min-h-[365px] md:min-h-[250px] lg:min-h-[300px] bg-gradient-secondary rounded-[10px] md:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[15px] px-5 lg:px-6 xl:px-7 py-7 max-w-full lg:max-w-[487px] w-full flex flex-col" role="listitem"><div class="flex-grow"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="cs-h3 text-white">Speed</h3><p class="cs-text text-white">Separated platforms and legacy processes create friction, slowing the flow of assets and capital across markets.</p></div></section></div><section class="w-full flex justify-center items-center mx-auto"><div class="w-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center rounded-3xl"><span class="cs-h5 justify-center flex items-center text-center dark:text-white/50 lg:pr-[2px] xl:pr-0 uppercase mb-5 text-neutral-900/50">Your Solution</span><h2 class="cs-h2 w-full flex items-center justify-center text-center dark:text-white mb-5 px-8 md:px-0 xl:pr-0 lg:pl-0">Hello Hybrid</h2><div class="cs-text-big w-full text-center dark:text-white text-neutral-900/50 xl:max-w-full md:px-0 px-0 sm:px-6 lg:pl-0 lg:pr-[5px]"><div class="relative richtext flex items-center flex-col"><p class="rt">Clearstream is at the forefront of this evolution, helping the market to build a more connected, efficient, and innovative infrastructure landscape.</p></div></div></div></section><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 justify-center" role="list"><section class="min-h-[365px] md:min-h-[250px] lg:min-h-[300px] bg-gradient-primary rounded-[10px] md:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[15px] px-5 lg:px-6 xl:px-7 py-7 max-w-full lg:max-w-[487px] w-full flex flex-col" role="listitem"><div class="flex-grow"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="cs-h3 text-white">Digital securities</h3><p class="cs-text text-white">Broader investment opportunities through tokenization, digital-native assets, and enhanced asset mobility.</p></div></section><section class="min-h-[365px] md:min-h-[250px] lg:min-h-[300px] bg-gradient-primary rounded-[10px] md:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[15px] px-5 lg:px-6 xl:px-7 py-7 max-w-full lg:max-w-[487px] w-full flex flex-col" role="listitem"><div class="flex-grow"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="cs-h3 text-white">Digital collateral</h3><p class="cs-text text-white">Diversified collateral pool through new eligible asset classes and improved access to liquidity.</p></div></section><section class="min-h-[365px] md:min-h-[250px] lg:min-h-[300px] bg-gradient-primary rounded-[10px] md:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[15px] px-5 lg:px-6 xl:px-7 py-7 max-w-full lg:max-w-[487px] w-full flex flex-col" role="listitem"><div class="flex-grow"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="cs-h3 text-white">Digital cash</h3><p class="cs-text text-white">Flexible cash and settlement across wholesale CBDC, stablecoins, tokenized deposits, and fiat.</p></div></section></div><div class=" sm:px-[1px] md:px-[0px] lg:px-[0px] xl:px-[122px] flex justify-center"><div class="rounded-[20px] lg:rounded-[30px] xl:rounded-[30px] overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="w-full md:h-[396px] lg:h-[542px] h-[193px] xl:h-[700px] overflow-hidden relative"><video controls="" poster="/caas/v1/media/5591510/data/0749be35f3d65624afc7a3f37613b053/landscape_ratio16x9/1280/digital-091-image.jpg" title="" preload="none" class="w-full h-full object-contain"><source src="/caas/v1/media/5591496/data/690a317ef539433b3c3415f7a6866fd0/digital-09-60-sec-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video></div></div></div><div class="w-full xl:pl-[107px] xl:pt-[60px] xl:pr-[60px] lg:pt-[60px] md:pt-[60px] pt-[30px] xl:pb-[60px] md:px-[30px] md:py-[60px] px-[20px] py-[30px]" role="region"><div><p class="cs-h5 text-black/50 dark:text-white/50 uppercase mb-[15px]">Your benefits</p><h2 class="cs-h2 text-black dark:text-white w-full sm:mt-4 mt-2">Move forward at your own pace</h2><div class="sm:mt-[60px] mt-[30px] grid grid-cols-1  sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 xl:gap-x-[26px] lg:gap-x-[20px] md:gap-x-[30px] md:gap-y-[60px] gap-y-[60px]"><div class="flex flex-col items-start" role="article" tabindex="0"><img alt="teaser image" role="img" loading="lazy" width="65" height="65" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain filter brightness-1 dark:invert-0 invert h-[65px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4667380/data/1be4d18991cb56a14b62e277c3e41b8f"/><p class="cs-text-medium font-bold mt-[30px] text-black dark:text-white mb-[15px]">Efficiency</p><p class="cs-text-medium text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 lg:w-3/4">Accelerate growth with scalable infrastructure built for speed and liquidity.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start" role="article" tabindex="0"><img alt="teaser image" role="img" loading="lazy" width="65" height="65" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain filter brightness-1 dark:invert-0 invert h-[65px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4667584/data/47e34d8036eec71d5817a178768fd56a"/><p class="cs-text-medium font-bold mt-[30px] text-black dark:text-white mb-[15px]">Expertise</p><p class="cs-text-medium text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 lg:w-3/4">Leverage our proven D7 technology already operating on a global scale.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start" role="article" tabindex="0"><img alt="teaser image" role="img" loading="lazy" width="65" height="65" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain filter brightness-1 dark:invert-0 invert h-[65px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4668340/data/f114e4a05e819272df2f515c8f624ea8"/><p class="cs-text-medium font-bold mt-[30px] text-black dark:text-white mb-[15px]">Broader investment coverage</p><p class="cs-text-medium text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 lg:w-3/4">Unlock new digital asset classes alongside traditional securities in one integrated platform.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start" role="article" tabindex="0"><img alt="teaser image" role="img" loading="lazy" width="65" height="65" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain filter brightness-1 dark:invert-0 invert h-[65px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4667564/data/b1746a88bce460bcce1e875c400e99e7"/><p class="cs-text-medium font-bold mt-[30px] text-black dark:text-white mb-[15px]">24/7/365</p><p class="cs-text-medium text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 lg:w-3/4">Engage with markets anytime with continuous availability and settlement.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start" role="article" tabindex="0"><img alt="teaser image" role="img" loading="lazy" width="65" height="65" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain filter brightness-1 dark:invert-0 invert h-[65px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4667952/data/48fc20b2d67c1131c9d8cb41bcc9aabc"/><p class="cs-text-medium font-bold mt-[30px] text-black dark:text-white mb-[15px]">Interoperability</p><p class="cs-text-medium text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 lg:w-3/4">Connect digital and traditional markets without creating new silos.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start" role="article" tabindex="0"><img alt="teaser image" role="img" loading="lazy" width="65" height="65" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain filter brightness-1 dark:invert-0 invert h-[65px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4667968/data/1a06836761e0f5a8f10d9b2bf54ee9ac"/><p class="cs-text-medium font-bold mt-[30px] text-black dark:text-white mb-[15px]">Hybrid by design</p><p class="cs-text-medium text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 lg:w-3/4">Maintain existing operations alongside new digital capabilities.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start" role="article" tabindex="0"><img alt="teaser image" role="img" loading="lazy" width="65" height="65" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain filter brightness-1 dark:invert-0 invert h-[65px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4668074/data/1dc92a3a1d9f2df31a9c5b4263f06077"/><p class="cs-text-medium font-bold mt-[30px] text-black dark:text-white mb-[15px]">Flexibility</p><p class="cs-text-medium text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 lg:w-3/4">Adopt digital assets at your own pace.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start" role="article" tabindex="0"><img alt="teaser image" role="img" loading="lazy" width="65" height="65" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain filter brightness-1 dark:invert-0 invert h-[65px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4667726/data/3e7fe4e29dfae33bd62f3e3c9839030c"/><p class="cs-text-medium font-bold mt-[30px] text-black dark:text-white mb-[15px]">Trusted partner</p><p class="cs-text-medium text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 lg:w-3/4">Benefit from Clearstream&#x27;s expertise, scale, and market reach.</p></div></div></div></div><section class="w-full flex justify-center items-center mx-auto"><div class="w-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center rounded-3xl"><span class="cs-h5 justify-center flex items-center text-center dark:text-white/50 lg:pr-[2px] xl:pr-0 uppercase mb-5 text-neutral-900/50">Leverage our experience</span><h2 class="cs-h2 w-full flex items-center justify-center text-center dark:text-white mb-5 px-8 md:px-0 xl:pr-0 lg:pl-0">Best positioned to meet all your needs</h2><div class="cs-text-big w-full text-center dark:text-white text-neutral-900/50 xl:max-w-full md:px-0 px-0 sm:px-6 lg:pl-0 lg:pr-[5px]"><div class="relative richtext flex items-center flex-col"><p class="rt">Our expertise combines established market infrastructure with proven, live digital markets capabilities.</p></div></div></div></section><div class="w-full max-w-full"><div class="flex w-full justify-end pb-4"><button class="flex justify-center gap-3 items-center group"><span class="font-normal text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-base">Expand All</span><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="5" height="5" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-10 h-10 hidden group-hover:block dark:invert" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/expandAllWhite.9b44acf4.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="5" height="5" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-10 h-10 group-hover:hidden dark:invert" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/expandAllBlack.880e6f91.svg"/></button></div><div class=""><div class="w-full max-w-full"><hr class="w-full border-t border-black h-[1px] dark:border-white"/><div class="w-full flex justify-between items-start cursor-pointer py-8 lg:py-12" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordionContent-0-5452098" aria-expanded="false"><p class="cs-h3 text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">D7 Digital</p><div class="text-neutral-900 mt-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="10" height="10" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-3.5 sm:w-4 lg:w-5 xl:w-6 dark:invert false" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/accordion-arrow.svg"/></div></div></div><section id="accordionContent-0-5452098" class="w-full max-w-full pb-10 hidden"><div class="relative richtext richtext-two-column articleRichText cs-text-medium"><p class="rt">Our D7 Digital solution enables fully digital securities issuance through a streamlined end-to-end process. Designed for scale, it allows dematerialized securities to be issued within seconds, supporting high-volume activity across multiple asset classes. Already processing more than 45,000 digital security issuances each week and over €90 billion in issuance volume, D7 Digital has moved beyond the use-case stage.</p><p class="rt"><u class="rt"><a class="w-60 cs-text min-h-14 pl-5 py-2 pr-2 justify-between items-center rounded-full flexbtn flex group   bg-white hover:bg-black text-neutral-900  text-base font-normal leading-5 btn-cta-primary-3 rt inline-flex " target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/securities-services/issuance-solutions/digital-issuance"><span class="group-hover:text-white" style="word-break:break-word">Learn more</span><span class="relative flex justify-center items-center shrink-0 rounded-full w-10 h-10 bg-black group-hover:bg-white " aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right-dark.svg"/></span></a></u></p></div></section></div><div class=""><div class="w-full max-w-full"><hr class="w-full border-t border-black h-[1px] dark:border-white"/><div class="w-full flex justify-between items-start cursor-pointer py-8 lg:py-12" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordionContent-1-5452098" aria-expanded="false"><p class="cs-h3 text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">D7 DLT</p><div class="text-neutral-900 mt-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="10" height="10" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-3.5 sm:w-4 lg:w-5 xl:w-6 dark:invert false" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/accordion-arrow.svg"/></div></div></div><section id="accordionContent-1-5452098" class="w-full max-w-full pb-10 hidden"><div class="relative richtext richtext-two-column articleRichText cs-text-medium"><p class="rt">D7 DLT complements D7 Digital by a Distributed Ledger Technology (DLT)-based architecture to enable seamless tokenization of securities. With D7 DLT, you can issue securities on blockchain, enabling future settlement against digital cash. The solution is now live, with issuances of commercial paper as of 2026.</p><p class="rt"><a class="w-60 cs-text min-h-14 pl-5 py-2 pr-2 justify-between items-center rounded-full flexbtn flex group   bg-white hover:bg-black text-neutral-900  text-base font-normal leading-5 btn-cta-primary-3 rt inline-flex " target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/securities-services/issuance-solutions/digital-issuance"><span class="group-hover:text-white" style="word-break:break-word">Learn more</span><span class="relative flex justify-center items-center shrink-0 rounded-full w-10 h-10 bg-black group-hover:bg-white " aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right-dark.svg"/></span></a></p></div></section></div><div class=""><div class="w-full max-w-full"><hr class="w-full border-t border-black h-[1px] dark:border-white"/><div class="w-full flex justify-between items-start cursor-pointer py-8 lg:py-12" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordionContent-2-5452098" aria-expanded="false"><p class="cs-h3 text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Crypto custody</p><div class="text-neutral-900 mt-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="10" height="10" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-3.5 sm:w-4 lg:w-5 xl:w-6 dark:invert false" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/accordion-arrow.svg"/></div></div></div><section id="accordionContent-2-5452098" class="w-full max-w-full pb-10 hidden"><div class="relative richtext richtext-two-column articleRichText cs-text-medium"><p class="rt">Our crypto assets custody solution offers a comprehensive and familiar solution tailored to the needs of traditional financial institutions. Gain access to a highly trusted, institutional grade and regulatory compliant solution by leveraging our ICSD account infrastructure.</p><p class="rt"><a class="w-60 cs-text min-h-14 pl-5 py-2 pr-2 justify-between items-center rounded-full flexbtn flex group   bg-white hover:bg-black text-neutral-900  text-base font-normal leading-5 btn-cta-primary-3 rt inline-flex " target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/securities-services/custody-and-investor-solutions/crypto-assets"><span class="group-hover:text-white" style="word-break:break-word">Learn more</span><span class="relative flex justify-center items-center shrink-0 rounded-full w-10 h-10 bg-black group-hover:bg-white " aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right-dark.svg"/></span></a></p></div></section></div><div class=""><div class="w-full max-w-full"><hr class="w-full border-t border-black h-[1px] dark:border-white"/><div class="w-full flex justify-between items-start cursor-pointer py-8 lg:py-12" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordionContent-3-5452098" aria-expanded="false"><p class="cs-h3 text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">ECB digital markets solution</p><div class="text-neutral-900 mt-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="10" height="10" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-3.5 sm:w-4 lg:w-5 xl:w-6 dark:invert false" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/accordion-arrow.svg"/></div></div></div><section id="accordionContent-3-5452098" class="w-full max-w-full pb-10 hidden"><div class="relative richtext richtext-two-column articleRichText cs-text-medium"><p class="rt">With the Eurosystem’s introduction of a permanent digital euro, institutional interest in DLT-based solutions is expected to accelerate. To support Eurosystem’s continuing commitment to safe, efficient settlement in central bank money (CeBM), we are participating in the ECB’s initiative on DLT settlement.</p><p class="rt"><a class="w-60 cs-text min-h-14 pl-5 py-2 pr-2 justify-between items-center rounded-full flexbtn flex group   bg-white hover:bg-black text-neutral-900  text-base font-normal leading-5 btn-cta-primary-3 rt inline-flex " target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-disabled="false" href="https://www.ecb.europa.eu/paym/target/pontes/html/index.en.html"><span class="group-hover:text-white" style="word-break:break-word">Learn more</span><span class="relative flex justify-center items-center shrink-0 rounded-full w-10 h-10 bg-black group-hover:bg-white " aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right-dark.svg"/></span></a></p></div></section></div></div><section class="w-full flex justify-center items-center mx-auto"><div class="w-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center rounded-3xl"><span class="cs-h5 justify-center flex items-center text-center dark:text-white/50 lg:pr-[2px] xl:pr-0 uppercase mb-5 text-neutral-900/50">Keep exploring</span><h2 class="cs-h2 w-full flex items-center justify-center text-center dark:text-white mb-5 px-8 md:px-0 xl:pr-0 lg:pl-0">Related resources</h2><div class="cs-text-big w-full text-center dark:text-white text-neutral-900/50 xl:max-w-full md:px-0 px-0 sm:px-6 lg:pl-0 lg:pr-[5px]"><div class="relative richtext flex items-center flex-col"></div></div></div></section><div data-testid="marketing-teaser-container" class="w-full max-w-[1500px] flex gap-2 flex-wrap align-center justify-center"><div class="relative basis-full sm:basis-[calc(50%-0.5rem)] lg:basis-[calc(33.333%-0.5rem)] xl:basis-[calc(25%-0.5rem)] h-auto p-2 gap-5 rounded-[10px] sm:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[30px] bg-white dark:bg-dark_primary group"><div class="w-full rounded-[15px] xl:rounded-[20px] px-auto lg:py-[54px] py-[75px] px-10 flex justify-center items-center mb-5 bg-gradient-secondary"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="70" height="70" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 w-[70px] sm:w-[120px] lg:w-[72px] xl:w-[72px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4668200/data/4f044348d7ad7f1ace20a67193151ccf"/></div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row w-[95%] px-2 group gap-[10px] sm:gap-0 mt-0 pb-10"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="cs-h5 text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 uppercase md:mt-2 lg:mt-0 mt-0 w-[95%] sm:w-full">Pontes</p><h3 class="cs-h3 w-full dark:text-white line-clamp-2"><a class="after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:top-0 after:left-0 after:right-0 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] after:z-10" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/newsroom/260817-5436274">Clearstream joins ECB Pontes testing</a></h3><p class="cs-text text-neutral-900 dark:text-white/50 w-[95%] sm:w-full lg:w-[95%] pr-3 sm:pr-0">Clearstream joins the ECB’s Pontes testing program to support DLT-based settlement in central bank money.</p></div><a class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 z-10 mb-[-7px] sm:mb-0" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/newsroom/260817-5436274"><div role="button" class="flex justify-center items-center shrink-0 bg-black dark:bg-white dark:group-hover:bg-black rounded-full group-hover:bg-white border border-transparent group-hover:border-black w-10 h-10 cursor-pointer"><img alt="arrow-right" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="14" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-0 dark:group-hover:opacity-100" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right.svg"/><img alt="arrow right icon" aria-label="arrow right icon" loading="lazy" width="12" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 dark:opacity-100 dark:group-hover:opacity-0" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right-dark.svg"/></div></a></div></div><div class="relative basis-full sm:basis-[calc(50%-0.5rem)] lg:basis-[calc(33.333%-0.5rem)] xl:basis-[calc(25%-0.5rem)] h-auto p-2 gap-5 rounded-[10px] sm:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[30px] bg-white dark:bg-dark_primary group"><div class="w-full rounded-[15px] xl:rounded-[20px] px-auto lg:py-[54px] py-[75px] px-10 flex justify-center items-center mb-5 bg-gradient-primary"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="70" height="70" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 w-[70px] sm:w-[120px] lg:w-[72px] xl:w-[72px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4668340/data/f114e4a05e819272df2f515c8f624ea8"/></div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row w-[95%] px-2 group gap-[10px] sm:gap-0 mt-0 pb-10"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="cs-h5 text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 uppercase md:mt-2 lg:mt-0 mt-0 w-[95%] sm:w-full">D7 DLT</p><h3 class="cs-h3 w-full dark:text-white line-clamp-2"><a class="after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:top-0 after:left-0 after:right-0 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] after:z-10" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/newsroom/260629-5355756">First issuance on D7 DLT</a></h3><p class="cs-text text-neutral-900 dark:text-white/50 w-[95%] sm:w-full lg:w-[95%] pr-3 sm:pr-0">EIB completes its first DLT-native commercial paper issuance on D7, advancing tokenized capital markets.</p></div><a class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 z-10 mb-[-7px] sm:mb-0" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/newsroom/260629-5355756"><div role="button" class="flex justify-center items-center shrink-0 bg-black dark:bg-white dark:group-hover:bg-black rounded-full group-hover:bg-white border border-transparent group-hover:border-black w-10 h-10 cursor-pointer"><img alt="arrow-right" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="14" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-0 dark:group-hover:opacity-100" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right.svg"/><img alt="arrow right icon" aria-label="arrow right icon" loading="lazy" width="12" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 dark:opacity-100 dark:group-hover:opacity-0" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right-dark.svg"/></div></a></div></div><div class="relative basis-full sm:basis-[calc(50%-0.5rem)] lg:basis-[calc(33.333%-0.5rem)] xl:basis-[calc(25%-0.5rem)] h-auto p-2 gap-5 rounded-[10px] sm:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[30px] bg-white dark:bg-dark_primary group"><div class="w-full rounded-[15px] xl:rounded-[20px] px-auto lg:py-[54px] py-[75px] px-10 flex justify-center items-center mb-5 bg-gradient-secondary"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="70" height="70" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 w-[70px] sm:w-[120px] lg:w-[72px] xl:w-[72px]" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4668302/data/0c32d2837ee00450ed0b544063df2c32"/></div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row w-[95%] px-2 group gap-[10px] sm:gap-0 mt-0 pb-10"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="cs-h5 text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 uppercase md:mt-2 lg:mt-0 mt-0 w-[95%] sm:w-full">White paper</p><h3 class="cs-h3 w-full dark:text-white line-clamp-2"><a class="after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:top-0 after:left-0 after:right-0 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] after:z-10" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/newsroom/260304-4990388">The path to digital asset interoperability</a></h3><p class="cs-text text-neutral-900 dark:text-white/50 w-[95%] sm:w-full lg:w-[95%] pr-3 sm:pr-0">A new industry white paper outlines a framework to advance interoperability in digital assets.</p></div><a class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 z-10 mb-[-7px] sm:mb-0" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/newsroom/260304-4990388"><div role="button" class="flex justify-center items-center shrink-0 bg-black dark:bg-white dark:group-hover:bg-black rounded-full group-hover:bg-white border border-transparent group-hover:border-black w-10 h-10 cursor-pointer"><img alt="arrow-right" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="14" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-0 dark:group-hover:opacity-100" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right.svg"/><img alt="arrow right icon" aria-label="arrow right icon" loading="lazy" width="12" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 dark:opacity-100 dark:group-hover:opacity-0" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right-dark.svg"/></div></a></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><div class="relative w-full py-4"><footer class="w-full max-w-[1500px] mt-20"><div class="rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden shadow-md bg-white dark:bg-dark_primary w-full max-w-[1500px] h-[230px] md:h-[202px] lg:h-[218px] xl:h-[194px] py-6 px-8 sm:px-12 flex flex-col xl:flex-row items-start xl:items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="cs-text-big md:w-[648px] lg:w-[824px] xl:w-[687px] w-full font-light dark:text-white">Clearstream News: To receive our newsletters, complete the subscription form. </p><div class="flex gap-2 sm:gap-4 h-[60px] w-full sm:w-1/2 lg:max-w-[396px] lg:items-center lg:justify-end"><a class="w-96 cs-text min-h-14 pl-5 py-2 pr-2 justify-between items-center rounded-full flexbtn flex group bg-gradient-primary  text-white  text-base font-normal leading-5  " target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-disabled="false" href="https://smc-lp.s4hana.ondemand.com/eu/p/871vi?"><span class="" style="word-break:break-word">Subscribe</span><span class="relative flex justify-center items-center shrink-0 rounded-full w-10 h-10 bg-black group-hover:bg-white " aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right-dark.svg"/></span></a></div></div><div class="max-w-[1500px] w-full"><div class="max-w-[1500px] h-[1px] opacity-20 border-b border-black dark:border-white pt-20 pb-15"></div><section class="flex flex-col xl:flex-row h-full w-full  pb-6 gap-4"><div class="md:w-1/2 xl:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-start gap-4 min-h-[150px] mt-6"><img alt="Deutsche Börse Group Logo" loading="lazy" width="380" height="72" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 bg-center bg-cover bg-no-repeat dark:hidden" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4602812/data/86a769ff5b08c1302dbc6feb3939f925"/><img alt="Deutsche Börse Group Logo" loading="lazy" width="380" height="72" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 bg-center bg-cover bg-no-repeat hidden dark:block" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4922482/data/84a9352fcb78de630b965787a9381d5c"/><p class="cs-text w-full md:w-[484px] gap-6 overflow-hidden">Clearstream is part of Deutsche Börse Group, an international exchange organization and provider of innovative market infrastructures. Our vision is to create the leading securities and funds servicing ecosystems of tomorrow jointly with our clients and partners. </p><a class="cs-text underline" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/about-clearstream">Find out more</a></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row xl:w-1/2 h-full w-full border-b-0 pb-6 gap-4 lg:ml-0"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/2 mt-6"><p class="cs-text font-bold uppercase mb-2">Applications</p><div class="w-full h-[1px] mt-2 opacity-20 bg-black dark:bg-white"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4"><ul class="space-y-2"><li><a class="cs-text text-black dark:text-white hover:underline" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="https://codelist.